# Room Schema Files
#
# This directory contains Room database schema JSON files exported during build.
# These files are generated by Room when exportSchema = true and serve as
# the canonical schema reference for migration testing.
#
# The schema file for version 1 will be generated at:
#   data/schemas/com.lifepilot.data.database.LifePilotDatabase/1.json
#
# Run: ./gradlew :data:kspDebugKotlin to generate the schema file.
# Then commit the generated JSON file to track schema history.
